                                "sense_id": "eda52a6d-12ff-371a-9a3b-0bd7388ee02a",
                                "text": "Do ideals, symbols and beliefs lead people to act as they do? Or are the wellsprings of action and the drivers of history less ethereal: money, fear, the thirst for power, circumstance and opportunity, with culture as an afterthought? Scholars in the first camp are culturalists; in the second, materialists."
